notes.notes:
- during the run character is now tired, it takes time for a break;
- increased chance of dying from hunger or thirst;
- increased basic accuracy of zombie attacks;
- added highlighting slots in your inventory when moving objects;
- increased blood spatter when applying or receiving damage;
- fixed reset of acceleration time when extracting resources to the shelter;
- added indication of the point of movement of the character in the shelter;
- added animation of active icons in the shelter;
- when you hover on the icons of resources displayed a tooltip;
- added indication of the amount of mined stones and wood;
- active character in the shelter is highlighted by a ring;
- added animation of the lack of energy of the character when trying to give him a task;
- time acceleration button is highlighted in the active state;
- at the beginning of construction, the character stops performing the current task;
- exit from the raid zone occurs automatically when moving to the evacuation area;
- fixed other minor bugs.

- added the possibility of destroying unnecessary buildings in the shelter (button with a trash can icon);
- fixed marauders fading after receiving damage;
- rain filters and traps for animals eventually wear out and do not extract resources until they are repaired;
- fixed the growth of the number of zombies in the night defense;
- the rarity of finding the majority of things is fixed;
- katana, sledgehammer and axe are now much harder to find (also increased their value from the merchant);
- the influence of the Lucky specialization on finding rare things has been reduced;
- partners run away further when taking damage;
- fixed a bug with the installation of the watchtower;
- fixed duplicate buildings in the shelter;
- increased frequency of finding fuel barrels;
- fixed other minor bugs.

- improved performance;
- reduced the size of the game;
- landing near the fire stops the music;
- a splash was removed when landing near the fire in locations with water.

- added running of the player and team-mates (Shift key);
- added buttons to move all things to the warehouse/trunk and back;
- in the shelter, the character management is completely switched to the mouse;
- when you click on the icon of the active character in the shelter, the camera centers on it;
- fixed the change in the speed of play in the shelter from x2 to x1 when performing some actions;
- corrected the wrong level of energy in new survivors;
- the translucent trees do not lose their shadow;
- strengthened machine;
- corrected incorrect maintenance of the health of the player after treatment in the shelter;
- the number of sweets in the game is significantly reduced;
- fixed the mistaking of the characters' inventory in the shelter;
- fixed other minor bugs.

- the possibility of acceleration of time in 2 times is added to the shelter;
- the trees closing the player become transparent;
- partners who are in the house do not take part in the defense (corresponding icons appear on their icons);
- almost any action of the character in the shelter can be undone (above the icons appears a button in the form of a red cross);
- the placement of a new building can be canceled by pressing the Esc key;
- fixed the misalignment of inventory when checking by a companion animal traps or a rain filter;
- fixed a bug where it was impossible to fix a wooden gate;
- the characters do not get stuck after the completion of the blockage analysis;
- fixed the opening of the inventory window on top of the character characteristics window;
- fixed volume of ricochet sounds and opening of doors;
- reduced the likelihood of sounds when visiting the toilet;
- in the video settings, you can enable the refresh rate limit to 60 frames per second (enabled by default);
- fixed the disappearance of things from the lower slots of the improved warehouse;
- mates armed with melee weapons do not move far from the player;
- when the night comes, the flashlight turns on automatically;
- choice of the level of fatigue, in which it is necessary to suspend production, is converted into a slider;
- fixed other minor bugs.

- the aiming system has been reworked - now the player is aiming precisely in the direction of the mouse pointer;
- animals do not freeze when receiving damage;
- now the partners do not pursue the goal constantly, but return to the player;
- now it is impossible to heal a dead partner;
- fixed the possibility of meeting the same characters;
- removed artifacts on the flame of the fire;
- now you can not drink or feed a character over 100%;
- the new survivors inventory is grouped by default;
- fixed the possibility of passing mates and zombies to take fence and ruins in story mode (days 7 and 9);
- fixed ejection of NPC on the roof in the story mode (day 6);
- corrected the incorrect positions of new survivors in story mode (day 7, 10, 17);
- fixed a bug where the number of bullets became negative;
- fixed a bug where ammo was not spent in the inventory when firing;
- fixed black screen instead of fire in story mode (day 14);
- the chance of meeting new survivors is reduced;
- the satiety of sweets is reduced to 3%;
- removed the display of the number of bullets when using a melee weapon;
- added information about whistling when it is impossible to equip the camp;
- fixed incorrect display of percentages of thirst quenching with mineral water (only English version);
- fixed incorrect allocation of the player in the re-distribution of food.

- fixed loss of food after the night;
- fixed a freeze at the end of the History mode;
- fixed minor bugs.

- almost any window can be closed with the Esc key;
- windows do not appear on top of each other;
- fixed character shaking while moving;
- the movement of the car became smoother;
- the weapon is automatically recharged when changing;
- fixed shooting of the player when you click on the interface buttons;
- increased the base damage of melee weapons;
- increased chance of finding water.

Please report any bugs found in this thread. I will try to fix them in the shortest possible time.

- increased speed of movement of the player, team-mates and marauders;
- increased the basic accuracy of all weapons;
- incorrect definition of the system language has been fixed;
- fixed sound settings;
- fixed a bug with the loss of things from the trunk of the car;
- fixed a bug with the loss of team-mates when the night comes after an unsuccessful raid;
- fixed missing items when inventory is full at the time of trade.

Please report any bugs found in this thread. I will try to fix them in the shortest possible time.
